; load_filament_sensorless - DEPRECATED forwarding file, delete with RRF 3.8
; (CLAUDE.md, "Deprecated forwarding files").
; 3.7 renamed it to sys/meltingplot/filament/load-procedure.g.
; The old path is still called by the load.g of filament profiles generated before
; 2026-07 (they call the physical load directly and have no temps.g, so tpost0.g never
; regenerates them) - macro repair-filament-profile rewrites the profile.
; Every call warns on the console and in the event log (M118 P0 L1, with the profile
; name where the call carries it), so the remaining callers can be found and fixed
; before 3.8.

M118 P0 L1 S"Warning: deprecated load_filament_sensorless - run repair-filament-profile"
M98 P"0:/sys/meltingplot/filament/load-procedure.g"
